{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1406,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51292b3a742f195616a668f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好机会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1639025f3b5f29c1ef1858009873107078d3eda7f93f8ef157fb1b6748ab4573",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bdcf116e17a3d94138d3603",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好运降临了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "504566315287d212ccc32fb586010eaa47cd3f90a3978ebb92fa841b5d6c4bc9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22d506c7f7a51683729c5df6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……哎呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fdcfa484b081ce19b2cd3efcfe54420ffc4f8e8b36d4965dfb05e09136536db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abdbd96cbc0cc7c0275ed931",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f21bed79927e5236d335292545e9ebd0f5f41ee49249a49856519a27ee9095c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c066089ea7e4a00084184d09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "动作快。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bb6c6d5fc80a297159a1871b734ac8409cbb7ab470eb038e1042f083e186978",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99a78fded894f74aca3108f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "超无聊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5f3051b999e878ea0e1dc50ad71ef6c2c6bc98856dc085cc2d93ddb9d415c91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed1475265cb8d77ae2b647c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂喂。",
      "source_fingerprint": "252773b1cdec6603e83c4600b9257380188260d5dbbcd46db6e58c9ff9cb07ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16c1722e668d9bfd67288cd4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天是这个。\r\n记得摇着尾巴过来拿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdcd7eb34a7a131c4becdeb1a0b84046a7a88f87828f8c48781d58afccc2fc60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9339f03cda995e65651c13b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……啧。\r\n今天要提前结束了。\r\n我状态不太好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86f6f6491978dc1479597899bd46256d48f30300280736fcebfed31df5b442a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66d9c502b9717f0f7d4c4fbd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态低迷。\r\n……原因会是什么。\r\n让我听听你的看法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ac867ab6aba6aa43285f078570239eee8a034bd9f4a11e91db9361c80766f02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09106008e2504887aaf9c3a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵，状态近乎完美。\r\n喂，快点开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "845950d687b8e64cef73c2830f7b1c245b0139c86d7315e536ece83a3445edcc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e533eb074a6e192ae53182e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的道路由我自己开拓。\r\n无论如何，\r\n我总有一天会抵达巅峰……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a028bc3d7aab1162255b95db9894e30ecc8596acdc076ed7a190ecfc9d390ac2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4310f859822a996605f821cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天狼星是最明亮的星星，\r\n这件事你要时刻牢记在心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4994235c194050ec5b1b022c38dcfc99a07113c9bb0c529f46edaec53392b864",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b56ae5115d10564cf71ccb1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态比预期得更好。\r\n我要增加训练项目，\r\n你也快去准备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce45f7d33e8fcdf637e836c0727974c837ab02b9ddba2794bdc39e8a2a2cd4d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42b0e88503d5c2d65af252b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要我进行你制定的\r\n训练项目就赢过我。\r\n规则本来就是这样，不是吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "424958238182d37691c03896761c54d8ac10a3ccaff9b6e5555efcf3520571cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a873bc5be33b295e9f33e136",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是看似一成不变的日常，\r\n时间依旧每分每秒在流逝。\r\n仔细审视一切，省去无谓之事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a21e958bb13a0523767f08f45b89fdb5afc58dc48c822992cf6eb00da37e8113",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb42750b0df496ad707282ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真麻烦。\r\n这点程度虽然是还能跑……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7afc75ffb6654ff4f830bb985c6ebc56480822ee604ae72a1b407b9cd042d522",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d83bf93c4927e8f2149cfe26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊，该死的！\r\n今天那家伙一派轻松的表情\r\n动不动就在我脑中闪过。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed7143741c8738309fd31e1cd1393d039e216958d13bbfa36aa0a7a5ef36917f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:463fd433794f157ec14fd02c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……哈啊……啧。\r\n别用那种眼神看着我，我还能跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6701f9d65d72200f0bd026e86aca9474f10a08a5fe95433f99d05cccd2c3d928",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20e39f574454d9014a4de5ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我想喝香料味十足的汤。\r\n……待会去做给我喝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88fc8489a0a743187c048ec117b16c172282139e1c5de2feb27a5679d256969a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75b1ce49b80a8ae97ab97f46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果一直埋首参加竞赛就能\r\n抵达巅峰的话，我愿意奉陪……\r\n但实际上呢？啊？你解释看看啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a910dfa0924fff059e17a66bfe56d4f4788cc7e1fa33116eaf3e839ceb5a1a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1372eca7810a9486cdf26180",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被职权耍着玩可是让我厌恶到作呕。\r\n如果你是在明白这点的前提下这么做\r\n……就代表你应该做好觉悟了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf0fc1b8bb3ad9e7dc0b7fd847af5b8778307b06c04a1431f5fc026046a71902",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ab4e6022af8e2505844b70e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈！力量充沛到想笑出来，\r\n双脚非常轻盈！\r\n啊啊，这就是所谓的状态绝佳吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab8816c6c635d196c811cee3fa4bfd051461c456900dfa3deb8db23553f57447",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30e0eedc3c23d608206a6a84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "乖乖抱着期待坐着就好，小狗。\r\n我会带着荣耀之冠回来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf0cc926eecdfb23f817987e6deca0ec0f46cee2d6682a724914e475a314b892",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77de5cba26485c7fdcc5928f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "所有人让开，\r\n今天的胜利是属于我的。\r\n谁也别想碰……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "718c561f626f020519eba1a82ba42ee1486286401850e5bb0610ce9493c25a9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3479f95bb601088aecaae3d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会让观众席知道\r\n一等星有多么明亮。",
      "source_fingerprint": "130485cd0791bd6834f2ce00fe47a9d86cfc9d995270362b2c71cd2a40d09627",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6045162432c8c10e569a8da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态还不错。\r\n……哼，我会展示我的獠牙，\r\n给我睁大眼睛看好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4df42955cd9d32368a589348b38afe5b5893559f6b3c7b1fd8bcc232fc4b84b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fddb0c0bed9b242d2c0bca4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的选择没有错。\r\n既然如此，今天也只有\r\n胜利在前方等着我……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e990b2f479bed6811532a1c6ec5d2e4ff61a3a0f19099e3793446a2b4be6509",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d6ae2eef473298e387f25f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态还不错。\r\n就像以往一样，\r\n开拓道路吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecfabd7ffff701eae52f8c8f55a42a25012a83df241264731532f55210c66af5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74b59fea03f8bbe0eef91d90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要做的事情没有改变。\r\n唯有不断奔驰……直到胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f4fcc0737d478378d599e567d241ae771981ce840b56f429b8d9487df3e48fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7376d75aab3525ed49c773e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "差不多要开始了吧……\r\n看我席卷整座赛道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7aa7f9aab3324d731af0dcb22d4c7c3c80676fcf56b6f02c582fc4d38af2875c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5012e7bb8ceb7043b8e6c9bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……哼，\r\n跟状态好不好无关，\r\n今天的竞赛只有一次……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dac39e4305ae89aaff55ae105ff52d74947ae5f80ad3bbbbbe055ca82413103e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:066c9360a030b3d2c64ae5e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……唉！竟然输给了\r\n我眼中的输家。\r\n这就是竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "18d24de1670b697a5ac6e6a5a29efdfdf37f4f11d304da0710c5b755d7727269",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eac64b265d5e5a6d05d50053",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵，爱操心的个性跑出来啰，小狗。\r\n闭上嘴看着吧，\r\n我会让你忘记我状态不佳。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60971593dd345bd6e29b83808a6999f9e200b4b658af1dc2ca7bf5cbcb81d89d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d86b8dcb9ab90fb64f9db8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……明显是调整不完备啊，\r\n但……反省之后再说。\r\n我可不会做出放弃比赛这种事……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfa5830e434997c225562f74dd3b4f69bb5a2125d5f66f1cd4c7cbaabd2442a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2897fd031c399eafba4e23a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……啧。啊啊，可恶，\r\n注意力完全没办法集中啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "486e67ea8985736c9698b2f3fb2a9ef5ef5d813a6ea1df96220d893c86dd633e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6224d752f3924b24a4c270e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我该抵达的目标是颠峰……\r\n可不能让你看见丢脸的模样……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd32b5429f5d1e33f126e7a4b117206bbbd0252acd6c69362f76918976e7c9b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7a705584d0fd8696e915c31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5340d32cafefeb07fb71f273be0d9e41c17a0c3f97ce3ec0784aa70ad39fd299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:785c85abb33eaefff026eb91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看着吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "906942bbb604a244eb819071224dda2b492e8920fb3df0257cb4f93537c6ba8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1549a7835fd1c02bf7c6d72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a25799dd76bfa520a5f4c036ab04cdf7b7efa393e6aec83197ef3c295c8c44c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d82611d197a78f860215827c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很简单。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cb54d39c27a711e54de269f5c7781fa4bc1f7de37ba53cfc748b83975545d4e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:262b4c89f042876675dc96ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d56c21aca34e886ec318bf0c042d3b04361a8565a18a4568d1f9cb3234644f17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fef3232cd4dd9d93b860697b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "12a3d75820fc4414b98f3d27daf9918f1ed7624f3f238be344ff606794b30ba3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93a237faa7a9670217cb41d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别走丢了啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2761aca26e53149b3424b91f59808abbd7b1a063160c1e9cfa98e08cbb38a8ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2711f95801cbb64852b2ac60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦，还不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d19f3d6c8152a2d4c8f037c30f6e0acacb1244bb59aeeeec217970694b1fd35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:984fcd82558e7aee001d029b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来我似乎太小看你了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb7011527789e737ebe2969932c8c14d20768a57e8832f823e7a2949cf7beeef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efde164f917f121bc0b1b496",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你算是做得还不错，就夸夸你吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c8e73368848fb908db0ea2618e81794fe7e10a2ce885de7e3b5427cd7129944",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d01b3b4f5527b986c01c1b74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快追上来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1510ea089aee35f57add84da1a8262d492e5ee25ad4a1fcaf0c7f1c1a7da7d12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:818aae3a375f43973d6af0f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "绷紧神经！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fafe14c523948a653a1bc374df5d06fcaf3c54ed793f1b61b4c898bb6fc12292",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0612077d520fd3198709079",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可别让我看到丢脸的竞赛啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e919942fe2f7a823352c96423581407e82eee9ad9964e4dfd5bc381aa3336701",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a34848eead839247d480ece",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你算是做得还不错，就夸夸你吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c8e73368848fb908db0ea2618e81794fe7e10a2ce885de7e3b5427cd7129944",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8932b5ce3ad6340476994f33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的选择没有错。\r\n既然如此，今天也只有\r\n胜利在前方等着我……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e990b2f479bed6811532a1c6ec5d2e4ff61a3a0f19099e3793446a2b4be6509",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7cbe7cc48fc99172a6435c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "所有人让开，\r\n今天的胜利是属于我的。\r\n谁也别想碰……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "718c561f626f020519eba1a82ba42ee1486286401850e5bb0610ce9493c25a9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd43a977c5e3dcbc1ebaf1e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你算是做得还不错，就夸夸你吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c8e73368848fb908db0ea2618e81794fe7e10a2ce885de7e3b5427cd7129944",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:676f35367851c1dae805e3c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "始めるぞ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f2964516252c32077b1245d6421664b3d59281a2f368a22c6be11e3dfc5a113",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f6c19a6a7366bcd193c423c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我找到该做的事了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7425fccfa3737b71e7a19e91f021e410e87bf023b02d60158aa5491b58efe478",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03228763fbe21aae9063d7aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来找出原因吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "421a9c0b497af36428110645e76aa394c589bfcb02db225d2094ea899a045436",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4eee55bb9e0f96ffcd91b582",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶，太难看了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5ae2b11ad479853cd7a2736450475117715705822b85a76dcc97e93d48ba791",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15cadbc2983a81dfc64e9af0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啧，不会有下一次……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad90d2c034042eae35aa4c201bfd6e7b9bbe5e4bd7b9f3a8aa543ad985015b89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca8771f13832020c2ce48264",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哈哈！\r\n这下明白……谁是最强了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b04afa2f9180dc0bb097f137cc3059b635c9a238ec464e1084921f36fa18d0d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c493795415af40b717c319be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别发呆，进入下个阶段。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05332cb01f49cc887de8c2f9b0c88e1b3cd53a4bd9294bb1d1ca65e9b5f6a012",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96c6a1c6079af954b776ba37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "王座是属于我的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "110bbf4316c5d4c643ea3721921efa047341f95bd24460ff57267e9e98698b7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc93d8e315fd1982076a1d48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看，天狼星即将升起！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c79ddd2a19b8adc3a842c833c9fce6e72ab0df2676ff5c53cf3781c4b7b36f67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13c6105ffce5f475696cbb99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……鲁道夫。你……\r\n不是自大又傲慢的「皇帝」吗？\r\n既然如此……",
      "source_fingerprint": "14bcea7660c1bf15d68c8e71ab77518cb55759d026682b52ba57858e3e2065f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28cf84ea87aea277be6e8835",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是多伟大的纪录还是记忆……\r\n都会被我的光芒给掩盖！\r\n世界是……属于我的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b3e9d7e95c7a4749a605958fad38566737bb9a5087b89bb6fd9f7be0d9faffa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78d8da0d46b4c77acf885434",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……似乎听到有人在找我？呵，\r\n那些家伙这么没耐性啊？\r\n没办法，就让你们跳只舞吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "173c2717e36959d450c5efeede113ac0f9e85f7dd6f3e74c4509d989b09e57aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38a9d79fea816d96efcb96be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让大家见识一下一等星的光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "789bcc6904255b7e58a6da3b7cb2eef2e111f63354da6211f7d4945c05e0da02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d9038b90f262ce39a28e8fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小狗，你懂吧？可别移开视线了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1db23726521d52ffb9b7ba69b6fde28d1a9355b6d0f5aa1bd802c5f6d59e7529",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5cfc157ff319b6fbfc08e2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会让你看见顶点的景色！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbddf93b795c0a02d8b0e0a793d12642c3813c2f7096d7d6d9f031ca89d59639",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7e87586b4e7c74c0652f33c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你当时的撞球技术可说是\r\n烂到让人发笑呢。\r\n现在的话……勉强还能看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43cd7f3e3e21eedb64a7e750428f431e172ec36ee53e6360f7b4605069b82131",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eaacca775aac75727dc9e616",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要是不喜欢就不会穿了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08668d32f027fb88038ea4d3481585f4d11875278c17d9fcdb60d40054d0e7a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83aa7ce3c8a719874fa78c7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是什么轻飘飘的……\r\n算了，颜色是不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec74d339f49d6db5b28021e5a3e8da0469391cdc067f266ee2a4150b8cf66de4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:609ff76b630d9761fc37a9a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最重要的是设计，\r\n这点我绝不妥协。",
      "source_fingerprint": "848664cd26a1f08d0f7cf8326f5bbb976b607b44d563ca99c6d55d6341841fe4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f63230ee8469df5327e7c9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着它上街便会碰上很多麻烦事。\r\n总之就是很多。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ce24b3c73038ad4afa04ab43e66fe5e85e15e86f44c7c8f0587b0f773d04d1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1e1affd4a796fe955219b49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "舞步这种小事，\r\n我立刻就能记住。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca386183935fb381833b81769254e326d1a2416fc99f92c2a7be3d4c47e8f674",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abff80ba0d98b1fa6671c05b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我就是穿着这身衣服，\r\n君临于顶点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "478a6e96917dad9135c49579e73e173550b47d2fb45840be7c10a9c3ee59e3e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71608c8c3d007af91ef64fb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可不是换装娃娃哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d2d94b0121ca880ecb10c5e1ef514c5e1bebcfa33a306a4ffcc20674aa08b2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f82e85808d08839494d674d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要我陪你玩吗？小狗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "369a1af9dc0dd35db7556c6256b4345be3f0192bcb8b91e1acc50c280021fa6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3df39e20e35ecd24a56b883e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ま、コイツが1番落ち着くな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01d4348e7bd55b462ebe6091673a2a0e42c49d9d2107b9d260108b9389e463ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f5c919e81451dc6ba65f66e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "品があるもんのほうが、\r\n肌馴染みはいいな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "349c38c9227c555712a1f07df9686cdf4c7fe97ec82c65123ef7cd6364db81ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "70021"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
